---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { proofPoints } from '../data/portfolio';
---
<BaseLayout title="Mehak Pahwa | Business Operations and Analysis" description="Mehak Pahwa works across business operations, analysis, recruitment systems, and cross-functional coordination.">
  <div class="site-shell"><Header /><main id="main">
    <section class="home-hero">
      <div class="hero-atmosphere" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>STRUCTURE · CLARITY · MOMENTUM ·</span></div>
      <div class="hero-intro" data-reveal><p class="page-kicker"><span></span>Business operations · Early career</p><h1>I make complex work <em>easier to follow.</em></h1><p class="hero-lead">I’m Mehak Pahwa. My experience spans recruitment operations, reporting systems, content planning, and cross-functional coordination.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/work">See my work <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/experience">View experience <span>→</span></a></div></div>
      <div class="profile-canvas" data-reveal aria-label="Mehak Pahwa at a glance">
        <div class="canvas-top"><span>MEHAK / AT A GLANCE</span><i>2026</i></div>
        <div class="canvas-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><span>MP</span></div>
        <article class="canvas-card card-role"><small>NOW</small><strong>Project Manager</strong><span>Jarurat Care Foundation</span></article>
        <article class="canvas-card card-study"><small>FOUNDATION</small><strong>B.Com</strong><span>MDU · 2023–26</span></article>
        <article class="canvas-card card-score"><small>MILESTONE</small><strong>286 / 400</strong><span>CA Foundation · first attempt</span></article>
        <div class="canvas-footer"><span>Operations</span><span>Analysis</span><span>Coordination</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="proof-bar" aria-label="Professional highlights">{proofPoints.map((point) => <div><strong>{point.value}</strong><span>{point.label}</span></div>)}</section>
    <section class="home-story section-space"><div class="section-intro" data-reveal><p>01 / What I bring</p><h2>Practical experience, supported by a strong commerce foundation.</h2></div><div class="story-grid"><article data-reveal><span>Structure</span><h3>Systems that make progress visible</h3><p>I have built trackers, documented workflows, and used spreadsheet logic to organize recruitment activity.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>Coordination</span><h3>Clear information across teams</h3><p>As a Layer-1 Lead, I coordinated between the founder’s office and interns to keep work aligned.</p></article><article data-reveal><span>Range</span><h3>Experience across business functions</h3><p>My work includes operations, content strategy, campaign support, accounting, and economics.</p></article></div></section>
    <section class="featured-work section-space"><div class="feature-copy" data-reveal><p>02 / Featured work</p><h2>Recruitment operations at Jarurat Care Foundation</h2><p>I helped track recruitment activity, review process quality, document working methods, and coordinate information across levels.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/work">Explore the project <span>→</span></a></div><div class="feature-interface" data-reveal aria-hidden="true"><div class="fi-head"><span>PIPELINE / OVERVIEW</span><b>4 stages</b></div><div class="fi-stage"><i>01</i><strong>Applications</strong><span>Track</span></div><div class="fi-stage"><i>02</i><strong>Screening</strong><span>Check</span></div><div class="fi-stage active"><i>03</i><strong>Assignments</strong><span>Monitor</span></div><div class="fi-stage"><i>04</i><strong>Interviews</strong><span>Coordinate</span></div></div></section>
    <section class="page-cta"><p>There is more behind the overview.</p><h2>See the work, responsibilities, and decisions in context.</h2><div><a href="/work">Selected work ↗</a><a href="/experience">Experience ↗</a><a href="/about">About me ↗</a></div></section>
  </main><Footer /></div>
</BaseLayout>
